sequenceDiagram
	participant Op as Operator
	participant Page as Identity list page
	participant Hook as useIdentityListQuery
	participant API as GET /api/admin/identity/*

	Op->>Page: Open Users / Groups / Roles
	Page->>Hook: mount (pageIndex 0)
	Hook->>API: limit=10 offset=0 + filters
	API-->>Hook: items + total
	Hook-->>Page: render table page 1

	Op->>Page: Next
	Page->>Hook: goToPage(1)
	Hook->>API: limit=10 offset=10
	API-->>Hook: items + total
	Hook-->>Page: aria-live range + rows

	Op->>Page: Apply filter
	Page->>Hook: applyFilters (reset pageIndex 0)
	Hook->>API: limit=10 offset=0
	API-->>Hook: items + total

	Note over Hook: Stale responses ignored via requestId
	Note over Hook: If pageIndex >= pageCount, clamp and refetch once
